  "description": "Own hall door apartment ideally located just a few minutes walk from two Green Line Luas stops and the M50. The apartment has bright natural light and is complimented by a private south facing terrace with a tree-lined streetscape. It comes with a designated underground car parking space. The neighborhood incudes a range of sporting facilities, a park, a playground and excellent retail and service outlets. A number of schools are just a stroll away.\n\nThe accommodation consists of an Own Hall Door Entrance: large Open Plan Living/Dining Room with large picture windows overlooking the private front terrace,  Fitted Kitchen, separate Utility/Storage room, two Double Bedroom, one a Master with separate En-Suite, the other with its own direct entrance to Main Bathroom.",
